## Responsibility

First verify the accepted repository state automatically. If verification passes, review versioning, commit, and pull-request actions with the user as one release plan, then perform only the plan they explicitly authorize. The feature and its documentation, including the changelog, are already complete; do not alter application code, tests, or documentation.

